      "status": 200,
      "revision": "a3abb2d463df752356cb0945923d4cffa535242d",
      "reply": {
        "answer": "A VORTAC is a ground navigation aid that provides VOR azimuth, TACAN azimuth, and TACAN distance. It operates on paired VHF and UHF bands, and because the VOR and TACAN channels are paired, azimuth and distance information come from the same station. A TACAN-equipped aircraft receives distance from a VORTAC automatically.",
